<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/>
<meta content="FlyLab: laboratorio 3D inmersivo de navegación olfativa, vuelo, locomoción terrestre, alimentación y actividad conectómica inspirada en Drosophila." name="description"/>
<title>FlyLab 1.3.1 — Biomecánica y acicalamiento</title>
<link href="./styles.css" rel="stylesheet"/>
<script type="importmap">
  {
    "imports": {
      "three": "./vendor/three/build/three.module.js",
      "three/addons/": "./vendor/three/addons/"
    }
  }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
<main class="app-shell">
<header class="topbar">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">CONNECTOME-READY BEHAVIOR LAB · FEED · CLIMB · FLY</div>
<h1>FlyLab <span>1.3.1</span></h1>
<p>Una mosca autónoma con MaleCNS que puede aprender en línea cómo convertir órdenes descendentes en locomoción corporal estable.</p>
</div>
<div class="status-cluster">
<span class="status-dot" id="statusDot"></span>
<span id="statusText">Preparando simulación…</span>
</div>
</header>
<section aria-label="Controles principales" class="toolbar">
<button aria-label="Pausar o continuar" class="primary tool-btn" id="runBtn" title="Pausar o continuar" type="button"><span class="tool-ico">⏯</span></button>
<button aria-label="Forzar despegue" class="flight tool-btn" id="flightBtn" title="Forzar despegue" type="button"><span class="tool-ico">🪽</span></button>
<button id="groomBtn" class="tool-btn" title="Solicitar acicalamiento al posarse" aria-label="Acicalar">✧</button>
<button aria-label="Nuevo ensayo (borra memoria y repone alimento)" class="tool-btn" id="resetFlyBtn" title="Nuevo ensayo" type="button"><span class="tool-ico">↺</span></button>
<button aria-label="Borrar memoria" class="tool-btn" id="clearMemoryBtn" title="Borrar memoria" type="button"><span class="tool-ico">◌</span></button>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="separator"></div>
<label class="inline-field brain-field">Cerebro
  <select id="brainMode">
    <option value="proxy">Proxy</option>
    <option value="malecns-observe">MaleCNS Observe</option>
    <option value="malecns-control">MaleCNS Control</option>
  </select>
</label>
<label class="inline-field" title="Fluido mantiene el movimiento mientras calcula la red y prioriza muestras recientes. Sincronizado conserva cada muestra y espera a la red.">Ritmo neuronal
  <select id="neuralPacing">
    <option value="interactive" selected>Fluido</option>
    <option value="synchronized">Sincronizado</option>
  </select>
</label>
<span class="brain-status" id="maleStatus" title="Estado del puente MaleCNS"><i></i><span>Proxy</span></span>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="separator"></div>
<label class="inline-field">Fruta
        <select id="fruitType">
<option value="apple">Manzana</option>
<option value="banana">Banana</option>
<option value="orange">Naranja</option>
<option value="grape">Uva</option>
<option value="strawberry">Fresa</option>
</select>
</label>
<button aria-label="Añadir fruta" class="accent tool-btn" id="addFruitBtn" title="Añadir fruta" type="button"><span class="tool-ico">＋🍎</span></button>
<button aria-label="Quitar todas las frutas" class="tool-btn" id="clearFruitsBtn" title="Quitar todas las frutas" type="button"><span class="tool-ico">⌫🍎</span></button>
</section>
<section class="specimen-controls" aria-label="Ensayo y selección">
<span class="specimen-tag">D. MELANOGASTER <small>modelo anatómico procedural</small></span>
<label>Frutas <select id="fruitList"><option value="">Seleccionar fruta…</option></select></label>
<button id="addCenterBtn" type="button">Añadir en espacio libre</button>
<label>Calidad <select id="qualitySelect"><option value="high">Alta</option><option value="low">Ligera</option></select></label>
<a class="atlas-link" href="./anatomia.html">Atlas anatómico ↗</a><button id="exportSessionBtn" type="button">Guardar ensayo JSON</button>
</section><section class="workspace">
<div class="viewport-wrap">
<div aria-label="Arena tridimensional de FlyLab" class="viewport" id="viewport"></div>
<div class="view-hud top-left">
<div class="hud-label">ENSAYO</div>
<div class="hud-value" id="clockValue">0.0 s</div>
</div>
<div class="view-hud top-right">
<div class="hud-label">LOCOMOCIÓN</div>
<div class="hud-value mode" id="modeHud">TIERRA</div>
<div class="hud-sub" id="altitudeHud">0.20 m</div>
<div class="hud-sub" id="surfaceHud">suelo</div>
</div>
<div class="view-hud bottom-left legend-hud">
<div><span class="legend-dot fly"></span>Mosca</div>
<div><span class="legend-dot odor"></span>Volumen odorífero</div>
<div><span class="legend-line"></span>Trayectoria 3D</div>
<div><span class="legend-dot neural"></span>Actividad neural funcional</div>
</div>
<div class="placement-hint" hidden="" id="placementHint">Haz clic en el suelo para colocar la fruta</div>
<div aria-label="Vista y paneles" class="viewport-actions">
<button aria-controls="sidePanel" aria-expanded="false" class="icon-action active" id="panelToggleBtn" title="Mostrar instrumentación" type="button"><span class="action-icon">☰</span><span class="action-label">Datos</span></button>
<button class="icon-action" id="resetCameraBtn" title="Restablecer cámara" type="button"><span class="action-icon">⌂</span><span class="action-label">Cámara</span></button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="icon-action" id="neuralInspectorBtn" title="Seguir mosca e inspeccionar actividad neural" type="button"><span class="action-icon">◉</span><span class="action-label">Neural</span></button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="icon-action" id="flyViewBtn" title="Ver desde la cabeza de la mosca" type="button"><span class="action-icon">👁</span><span class="action-label">Mosca</span></button>
<button class="icon-action" id="focusBtn" title="Modo observación / pantalla completa" type="button"><span class="action-icon">⛶</span><span class="action-label">Pantalla</span></button>
</div>
<section class="neural-inspector" id="neuralInspector" hidden>
  <div class="ni-head">
    <div><span class="ni-kicker">NEURAL INSPECTOR</span><strong id="niAction">explorando</strong></div>
    <div class="ni-head-actions"><span id="niDominant">AL</span><button aria-label="Cerrar inspector neural" id="niCloseBtn" title="Cerrar inspector" type="button">×</button></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ni-body">
    <div class="ni-brain-wrap">
